{"articleNo":"356063","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=356063&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2022년도 상반기 강화군 다자녀 보육가정 대학생 등록금 지원사업 홍보","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.03.24","hit":"35647","attachments":[{"name":"2022년 상반기 다자녀가정 대학생 등록금 지원 공고.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=356063&attachNo=110509"},{"name":"배너용 URL 주소.txt","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=356063&attachNo=110510"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년도 상반기 강화군 다자녀 보육가정 대학생 등록금 지원사업 홍보</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">지원시기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: 2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">지원자격</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">지원대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">다자녀 가정의 모든 자녀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">만 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">세 미만 대학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일 기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">))</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">거주기준 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">대학생과 보호자 모두 공고일 현재 강화군에 주소를 두고 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년 이상 계속 거주</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">3) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">지원횟수</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">소속 학과 정규학기 수에 한함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">편입 등으로 학교가 변경되어도 총 지원횟수는 누적관리하며 타 대학 및 동일 대학 신</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">편입</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">재입학 모두 포함</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">4) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">접수기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: 2022. 3. 21.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) 09:00 ~ 4. 4.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) 18:00</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">5) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">접수방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">방문접수 또는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">e</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">메일</span><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">주소 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">인천광역시 강화군 강화읍 </span><a href=\"http://www.juso.go.kr/support/AddressMainSearch.do?searchType=TOTAL#self\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">강화대로</span></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">394, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">본청 별관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">층 자치교육과 </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">e</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">메일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><a href=\"mailto:ghedu@korea.kr\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">ghedu@korea.kr</span></a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:170%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">6) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">문의처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">강화군청 자치교육과 교육지원팀 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(032)930-3329</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 170%; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmwehBmCDUDuAjATgcQKIEECOBDAWQFMAzATQBsB5ABwDkAxAWwFUA6GgOwHMg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:170%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"12255\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"d